  "description": "Whether the Hayduke is loaded up for the long haul or set up for light and nimble singlespeed missions, this is the bike for your adventure rides.\n\nExploring Singletrack? Hayduke. Trying out your first bikepacking overnighter? You guessed it, Hayduke. Setting out on a month-long ride and beyond? Hayduke is here for it.\n\nThe Hayduke offers size-specific tube lengths and profiles for a precise fit and better performance on any adventure.\n\nThis generation features a longer wheelbase, lower center of gravity, and taller stack for added stability under load. Longer chainstays boost tire clearance to 3.0\" and improve heel clearance.\n\nWe've added more rack and top tube mounts for extra gear, while the external cable routing, threaded bottom bracket, and 44mm head tube ensure durability and easy maintenance.\n\n29\" wheels\n\nClearance up to a 3.0\" tire\n\n120mm travel\n\nCustom Tubing - seamless, quadruple-butted, tapered, Drawn Over Mandrel, size-specific, ED Coated, 4130 Chromoly\n\nPortage Dropout - for adjustability, singlespeed and upgradeability.\n\nUDH Compatible",
